# Contact form delivery — Formspree
#
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io/
# 2. Set the recipient email to: contactpegasustech01@gmail.com
# 3. Copy the form endpoint URL (looks like: https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id)
# 4. Paste it below as VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT
# 5. Rename this file to .env (it is gitignored — never commit real endpoints with secrets)
#
# The endpoint URL is public by design (Formspree webhook). No API key or secret
# is ever exposed client-side. Formspree handles spam filtering server-side.
#
# Example:
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xvldnqkj

VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
